# Written in the order of the GameWith Vesna team guide's Stellar Swirl
# rotations (Cryo supports, then the other supports, then Vesna's
# combo): Qiqi E Q > Sucrose E > Nicole E Q > Vesna combo. GameWith's
# Stellar Swirl teams are Vesna / Odette / Cryo Traveler / Vodyanitsa
# and Vesna / Cryo Traveler / Diona / Sucrose; for the Cryo slots it
# lists Odette, the Cryo Traveler, Diona and Qiqi, and for the fourth
# slot Vodyanitsa, Faruzan, Sucrose, Lan Yan and Qiqi. No guide puts
# Nicole in a Stellar Swirl team; GameWith lists her as an ATK% buffer
# for Vesna's Anemo driver team, so she takes a support slot here. Qiqi
# and Nicole burst when ready. Sucrose uses only her skill, as in
# GameWith's rotations.
# Vesna's combo as in every Vesna team (GameWith's): E [N C E]x2 Q E [N
# C E]x2, the burst when ready. With 5 Sword Essence per attack it pays
# for only four Windborne Swords even with the burst, so whenever the
# next one is not ready she keeps attacking until the fifth ends Armed
# for Action.
active qiqi;
qiqi skill;
if .qiqi.burst.ready {
  qiqi burst;
}
sucrose skill;
nicole skill;
if .nicole.burst.ready {
  nicole burst;
}
vesna skill,
      attack, charge, skill,
      attack, charge, skill;
if .vesna.burst.ready {
  vesna burst;
}
while .vesna.armed {
  while .vesna.armed && !.vesna.skill.ready {
    vesna attack, charge;
  }
  if .vesna.armed {
    vesna skill;
  }
  if .vesna.armed {
    vesna attack, charge;
  }
}
